nd=3D"637">huge</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"640" data-end=3D"676">CDS backend tries to process it but:=
</p>
<ul data-start=3D"678" data-end=3D"811">
<li data-start=3D"678" data-end=3D"703">
<p data-start=3D"680" data-end=3D"703">hits internal timeout</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"704" data-end=3D"736">
<p data-start=3D"706" data-end=3D"736">creates an <strong data-start=3D"717=
" data-end=3D"736">error HTML page</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"737" data-end=3D"775">
<p data-start=3D"739" data-end=3D"775">wraps the error in a ZIP container</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"776" data-end=3D"811">
<p data-start=3D"778" data-end=3D"811">returns it with <code data-start=3D"=
794" data-end=3D"799">.nc</code> extension</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"813" data-end=3D"870">This is why "big requests" produce Z=
IP instead of NetCDF.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"872" data-end=3D"875">
<h1 data-start=3D"877" data-end=3D"892">=F0=9F=8E=AF SOLUTION</h1>
<p data-start=3D"893" data-end=3D"959">We <strong data-start=3D"896" data-e=
nd=3D"920">must split downloads</strong> into small chunks that CDS can han=
dle.</p>
