<li data-start=3D"11531" data-end=3D"11617">
<p data-start=3D"11533" data-end=3D"11617">debug if some variables behave b=
adly (often <code data-start=3D"11577" data-end=3D"11598">total_precipitati=
on</code> needs more epochs)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"11618" data-end=3D"11711">
<p data-start=3D"11620" data-end=3D"11711">tune hyperparams (epochs, learni=
