<hr data-start=3D"2913" data-end=3D"2916">
<h1 data-start=3D"2918" data-end=3D"2939">=F0=9F=94=A5 IMPORTANT NOTE</h1>
<p data-start=3D"2940" data-end=3D"2960">Even after cropping:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2962" data-end=3D"3075">
<li data-start=3D"2962" data-end=3D"3020">
<p data-start=3D"2964" data-end=3D"3020">Training on <strong data-start=3D"=
2976" data-end=3D"2983">CPU</strong> with full global grid is <em data-star=
t=3D"3009" data-end=3D"3020">very slow</em></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3021" data-end=3D"3075">
<p data-start=3D"3023" data-end=3D"3075">Training on <strong data-start=3D"=
3035" data-end=3D"3042">GPU</strong> still uses ~3=E2=80=938GB VRAM per bat=
ch</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"3077" data-end=3D"3157">If you want <strong data-start=3D"=
3089" data-end=3D"3115">fast &amp; stable training</strong>, I recommend <s=
trong data-start=3D"3129" data-end=3D"3156">downsampling to 1=C2=B0 grid</s=
trong>.</p>
