<h1 data-start=3D"3164" data-end=3D"3200">=E2=9D=93 Last question before co=
ntinuing:</h1>
<p data-start=3D"3202" data-end=3D"3223">Would you like me to:</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3225" data-end=3D"3295">A) <strong data-start=3D"3232" da=
ta-end=3D"3266">Keep full global 720=C3=971440 grid</strong> (slow, heavy, =
but precise)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3296" data-end=3D"3300">or</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3301" data-end=3D"3383">B) <strong data-start=3D"3308" da=
ta-end=3D"3352">Automatically downsample to 1=C2=B0 (180=C3=97360)</strong>=
 (fast, ideal for Zeus miner)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3384" data-end=3D"3388">or</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3389" data-end=3D"3452">C) <strong data-start=3D"3396" da=
ta-end=3D"3425">Downsample to 2=C2=B0 (90=C3=97180)</strong> (super fast, s=
mall models)</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3454" data-end=3D"3541">=F0=9F=91=89 For Zeus subnet 18, <=
strong data-start=3D"3477" data-end=3D"3499">1=C2=B0 grid is optimal</stron=
g> and used in many climate AI competitions.</p>
