<h1 data-start=3D"2122" data-end=3D"2144">=F0=9F=9F=A5 IMPORTANT WARNING</h=
1>
<p data-start=3D"2146" data-end=3D"2185">Do <strong data-start=3D"2149" dat=
a-end=3D"2156">NOT</strong> train on your miner machine:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2187" data-end=3D"2311">
<li data-start=3D"2187" data-end=3D"2208">
<p data-start=3D"2189" data-end=3D"2208">It wastes GPU/CPU</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2209" data-end=3D"2229">
<p data-start=3D"2211" data-end=3D"2229">Makes miner slow</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2230" data-end=3D"2248">
<p data-start=3D"2232" data-end=3D"2248">Reduces uptime</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2249" data-end=3D"2278">
<p data-start=3D"2251" data-end=3D"2278">Reduces incentive rewards</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2279" data-end=3D"2311">
<p data-start=3D"2281" data-end=3D"2311">Validates penalize slow miners</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2313" data-end=3D"2320">Always:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2401">
<li data-start=3D"2322" data-end=3D"2346">
<p data-start=3D"2324" data-end=3D"2346">Train on a cloud GPU</p>
