</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"340" data-end=3D"350">Therefore:</p>
<p data-start=3D"352" data-end=3D"484">=F0=9F=91=89 <strong data-start=3D"3=
55" data-end=3D"385">You cannot resume training</strong> using your existin=
g model files.<br data-start=3D"418" data-end=3D"421">
=F0=9F=91=89 Because they do NOT contain epoch number or optimizer state.</=
p>
<p data-start=3D"486" data-end=3D"527">And your suspicion is absolutely cor=
rect.</p>
