<p data-start=3D"1533" data-end=3D"1546">This enables:</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1548" data-end=3D"1578">=E2=9C=94 Automatic continuation<=
/h3>
<p data-start=3D"1579" data-end=3D"1649">If the saved checkpoint is epoch 3=
, next training starts from epoch 4.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1651" data-end=3D"1677">=E2=9C=94 No manual tracking</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1678" data-end=3D"1747">Without it, you don't know which e=
poch corresponds to the checkpoint.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"1749" data-end=3D"1781">=E2=9C=94 Safety for long trainin=
g</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1782" data-end=3D"1854">If training stops after 18 hours, =
you resume exactly at the right place.</p>
